    },
    "sideEffects": false,
    "description": "The official TypeScript SDK for the Rizamo API: publish, schedule and measure social posts on Instagram, Facebook, TikTok, Threads, LinkedIn and YouTube, answer comments and messages, and receive webhooks.",
